        "original_id": "87995571-46a2-5cf2-95a4-11a988e64079",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Will Durant, Margaret Mitchell\n- Places: Europe\n- Roles: writer, historian, philosopher, author, journalist\n- Systems: Linear A\n- Concepts: Minoan civilization\n\nFacts:\n- Will Durant was born on November 5, 1885, and he was an American writer, historian, and philosopher.\n- Margaret Mitchell was born on November 8, 1900, and she was an American author and journalist.\n- The Minoan civilization has been described as the earliest civilization of its kind in Europe.\n- Historian Will Durant called the Minoans \"the first link in the European chain.\"\n- Linear A was the primary script used in palace and religious writings of the Minoan civilization.\n- Margaret Mitchell died on August 16, 1949.\n- Will Durant died on November 7, 1981.",
